WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.204
How does an AI model learn?

2
00:00:02.584 --> 00:00:04.090
Not from rules someone

3
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:05.830
wrote, but from examples.

4
00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.282
A neural network connects simple units.

5
00:00:09.662 --> 00:00:12.464
A signal passes from the inputs, through

6
00:00:12.464 --> 00:00:14.660
the hidden units, to an output.

7
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.734
Each connection has a weight, a number

8
00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.750
that says how much it matters.

9
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.548
During training, the model

10
00:00:22.548 --> 00:00:24.912
guesses, measures its error, and

11
00:00:24.912 --> 00:00:26.808
adjusts the weights a little.

12
00:00:27.188 --> 00:00:29.828
Repeat this many times, and the error

13
00:00:29.828 --> 00:00:32.714
falls, step by step, until it is small

14
00:00:32.714 --> 00:00:33.158
enough.

15
00:00:34.108 --> 00:00:36.922
So, an AI model learns by adjusting its

16
00:00:36.922 --> 00:00:39.154
weights to make fewer mistakes on

17
00:00:39.154 --> 00:00:39.706
examples.
